1. Agent activations evolve with affective-intentional modulation  
2. φ, entropy, curvature, and coherence are recalculated  
3. Bifurcation triggers phase transitions  
4. Beliefs and goals update based on semantic traces  
5. System restabilizes in a new cognitive phase  

